  "%U <hear> a distant rumble.  The world feels more empty.": "%U听见远方传来隆隆声。世界似乎更空旷了。",
  "%U <wish> %p knew the wizard password.": "%U希望%p知道巫师口令。",
  "%U <wish> %p had some more pickled slugs.  Yum!": "%U希望%p还有些腌蛞蝓。真美味！",
  "%U <wish> very, very hard.  Nothing happens.": "%U拼命许愿。什么也没发生。",
  "%U <wish> %p knew the purpose of the Y-rune.": "%U希望%p知道Y符文的用途。",
  "A flock of bats, a quarry of cockatrices.  %U <wish> %p were at home.": "成群的蝙蝠，成堆的石化鸡。%U希望%p此刻待在家里。",
