  "%R <return> from retirement ended tragically!": "%R退隐后复出，却以悲剧告终！",
  "Unlock POWDER now?": "现在解锁POWDER？",
  "Accessing the store...": "正在连接商店……",
  "%U <wish> for advice.  %U <hear> a fighter's voice: \"It's the mushroom fume making us weary.  We need lighter armour to keep in shape.\"": "%U希望得到建议。%U听见战士的声音：“蘑菇烟雾让我们疲惫不堪。要穿轻些的盔甲才能保持体力。”",
  "%U <wish> for advice.  %U <hear> a priest's voice: \"It's no use going down there.  The blue dragons are everywhere.  I haven't seen them, but I *know* it.\"": "%U希望得到建议。%U听见祭司的声音：“下去也没用。蓝龙无处不在。我没见过它们，但我就是知道。”",
  "%U <wish> for advice.  %U <hear> a wizard's voice: \"The shallowest part of the dungeon has some wicked magical energies running in it.  I swear I didn't fumble and cast it myself!\"": "%U希望得到建议。%U听见巫师的声音：“地牢最浅处有邪恶的魔法能量。我发誓不是我施法失误弄出来的！”",
  "%U <wish> for advice.  %U <hear> a thief's voice: \"They come in packs of three and sparkle so loud you can hear them through four meters of thick gravel!\"": "%U希望得到建议。%U听见盗贼的声音：“它们三个一群，闪耀得那么响，隔着四米厚的砾石都听得见！”",
  "%U <wish> for advice.  %U <hear> a thief's voice: \"Invisible == Invincible?  I wonder...\"": "%U希望得到建议。%U听见盗贼的声音：“隐形就等于无敌？我在想……”",
  "%U <wish> for advice.  %U <hear> an adventurer's voice: \"If the water of the lake freezes: Run!\"": "%U希望得到建议。%U听见冒险者的声音：“湖水一结冰，就快跑！”",
  "%U <wish> for advice.  %U <hear> a necromancer's voice: \"Be content with the zombies, disturb not the middle room!\"": "%U希望得到建议。%U听见死灵法师的声音：“有僵尸就知足吧，别惊扰中间的房间！”",
  "%U <wish> for advice.  %U <hear> a thief's voice: \"The kiwi's are hiding something!\"": "%U希望得到建议。%U听见盗贼的声音：“几维鸟藏着什么秘密！”",
  "POWDER is not like many similar looking games.  It is entirely reasonable for you to spend the next year actively playing it and still not reach dungeon level 15.": "POWDER与许多看似相似的游戏不同。即使认真玩上一年，你也完全可能到不了地牢第15层。",
  "This is not because of an arduous grind!  You could win a game of POWDER in three hours of play time.  It is because POWDER is hard, unforgiving, and a heck of a lot of fun.": "这不是因为需要漫长练级！只需三小时就有可能通关。原因在于POWDER困难、严苛，而且乐趣无穷。",
  "To explore deeper than dungeon level 15, however, you must unlock POWDER.  To help you reach those levels, as an added bonus, when unlocked, you gain access to the powerful Wish command that allows you to summon any item or creature.  Finally, unlocking will enable the stress test.": "要探索第15层以下，需要解锁POWDER。解锁后还能使用强大的许愿命令，召唤任何物品或生物，并启用压力测试。",
  "You have disabled in-app purchases.  Please re-enable and try again.": "你已关闭应用内购买。请重新开启后重试。",
  "This may take a while.  System pop-ups will take you through the rest of the process.  In the meantime, we return you to your regularly scheduled game.": "这可能需要一些时间。系统弹窗将引导你完成余下步骤。现在先回到游戏。",
  "The stress test will automatically play short games of POWDER, picking random levels and random actions to perform.  It is surprisingly soothing to watch the computer lose as often as you do.": "压力测试会随机选择楼层和行动，自动进行简短的游戏。看着电脑像你一样屡战屡败，竟然也很舒心。",
  "Access to the stress test requires your copy of POWDER to be unlocked, however.": "解锁POWDER后才能使用压力测试。",
  "Your copy of POWDER is already unlocked, so there is nothing to restore.": "你的POWDER已经解锁，无需恢复。",
  "Your copy of POWDER isn't unlocked yet, so there is no status to revoke.": "你的POWDER尚未解锁，没有可以撤销的状态。",
  "%d items, %d mobs, %d maps.": "%d件物品，%d个生物，%d张地图。",
